ss="logo-wrapper w-dyn-item"><img alt="Beaumier" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c6d6c45eaa55f57c6367749/69a6276cf3db3cf883403472_6997a950d20f9d826e36f307_beaumier400x200.avif" class="logo-image"/></div><div role="listitem" class="logo-wrapper w-dyn-item"><img alt="Schloss Elmau" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c6d6c45eaa55f57c6367749/69a6272aa842aa10ff1f5759_6997a97ea7975c8cc85867a7_schlosselmau400x200.avif" class="logo-image"/></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-main _56-56"><div class="container-large"><div class="max-width-850 margin-center text-align-center"><h2 class="text-style-h3">Communicate. Automate. Delight. Simplify.</h2><div class="spacer-24"></div><p>Save your team time by automatically communicating with your guests throughout their stays. Delight travelers with quick, direct, mobile responses.</p><div><div class="spacer-24"></div><a href="https://resources.canarytechnologies.com/get-hotel-guest-messaging-demo.html" class="button-main w-inline-block"><div>Learn How</div></a></div></div><div class="spacer-56"></div><div class="flexbox gap-16 space-between align-center tablet-direction-vertical"><div class="max-width-590 hide-mobile-landscape hide-mobile-portrait"><img width="590" loading="lazy" alt="Smart Hotel Messaging" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c6d1141d51c77692887d502/68e277c2d89f740ad8dd190f_guest_messaging_1_2x.webp"/></div><div class="max-width-590 mobile-text-align-center tablet-text-align-center"><h3 class="text-style-h5 text-color-blue">Automatically Engage Guests</h3><div class="spacer-24"></div><p>Use Canary’s Guest Messaging to communicate with guests throughout their stay. Create on-brand messages and easily customize when they send.</p></div></div><div class="spacer-56"></div><div class="flexbox gap-16 space-between align-center tablet-direction-vertical"><div class="max-width-590 mobile-text-align-center tablet-text-align-center"><h3 class="text-style-h5 text-color-blue">Create Better Guest Experiences</h3><div class="spacer-24"></div><p>Communicate in the way travelers prefer: texting. Provide modern guest communication by offering real-time messaging on channels your guests already use.</p></div><div class="max-width-590 hide-mobile-landscape hide-mobile-portrait"><img width="590" loading="lazy" alt="Better Guest Experiences" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c6d1141d51c77692887d502/68e277c2d89f740ad8dd1916_guest_messaging_2_2x.webp"/></div></div><div class="spacer-56"></div><div class="flexbox gap-16 space-between align-center tablet-direction-vertical tablet-direction-reverse"><div class="max-width-590 hide-mobile-landscape hide-mobile-portrait"><img width="590" loading="lazy" alt="Unified Hotel Inbox" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c6d1141d51c77692887d502/68e277c2d89f740ad8dd191d_guest_messaging_3_2x.webp"/></div><div class="max-width-590 mobile-text-align-center tablet-text-align-center"><h3 class="text-style-h5 text-color-blue">Simplify with One Unified Inbox</h3><div class="spacer-24"></div><p>Never miss a message again. With Canary’s unified inbox, all guest communications — from SMS, WhatsApp, OTAs, WeChat, LINE, email and more — are consolidated in one place.</p></div></div><div class="spacer-56"></div><div class="flexbox gap-16 space-between align-center tablet-direction-vertical"><div class="max-width-590 mobile-text-align-center tablet-text-align-center"><h3 class="text-style-h5 text-color-blue">Save Staff Time</h3><div class="spacer-24"></div><p>Reduce the amount of communication your team manages. AI Guest Messaging provides smart replies to guests, freeing your team for tasks needing a personal touch.</p></div><div class="max-width-590 hide-mobile-landscape hide-mobile-portrait"><img width="590" loading="lazy" alt="Provide timely guest info" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c6d1141d51c77692887d502/68e277c2d89f740ad8dd190a_messaging-4.webp"/></div></div></div></section><section class="section-main section-use-cases-experience"><div class="container-medium"><div class="flexbox gap-16 space-between"><div class="max-width-660 mobile-max-width-none mobile-text-align-center"><div class="spacer-56"></div><div class="flexbox mobile-justify-center"><div class="divider _250-3 blue"></div></div><div class="spacer-16"></div><h2 class="text-style-h3 text-color-white">Smoother Guest Communication Starts With Canary</h2><div class="spacer-16"></div><p class="text-color-white">Canary Messaging streamlines guest communication and saves your staff time through automated, broadcast and AI messages.</p><div class="spacer-40"></div><a href="https://resources.canarytechnologies.com/get-hotel-guest-messaging-demo.html" class="button-main w-inline-block"><div>Book a Demo</div></a></div><div class="max-width-450 mobile-display-none"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67d96a31f556fbb25bfa24cf/6863061948f999d007a1d670_happyhoteliers.webp" alt="" class="use-cases-experience-visual products tiny"/></div></div></div></section><section class="section-main _56-56"><div class="container-large"><div class="text-align-center"><h2 class="text-style-h3">Power real-time guest communication &amp; experiences with Canary</h2><div class="spacer-20"></div><div class="subheader large">Our turnkey guest messaging solution integrates seamlessly with your PMS.</div><div class="spacer-80"></div><div class="how-it-works-items-wrapper"><div class="how-it-works-item"><div class="how-it-works-number"><div>1</div></div><div class="spacer-48 tablet-spacer-20"></div><div class="how-it-works-image-wrapper"><img width="200" loading="lazy" alt="Unique Links per Guest visual" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c6d1141d51c77692887d502/653160e7316e0e8e3bf08254_canary-illustrations-messages-direct-send-1-653160dbdf336.webp"/></div><div class="spacer-32 tablet-spacer-20"></div><h3 class="text-style-h5">Stay connected to your guests</h3><div class="spacer-10"></div><p>Send personalized direct or broadcast messages to your guests at any point in their journey — pre-arrival, check-in, in-stay, checkout and post-stay</p></div><div class="how-it-works-item"><div class="how-it-works-number"><div>2</div></div><div class="spacer-48 tablet-spacer-20"></div><div class="how-it-works-image-wrapper"><img width="140" loading="lazy" alt="Automatic Notifications visual" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c6d1141d51c77692887d502/653160f276e6a269bc293a36_canary-illustrations-messages-automated-1-653160db46781.webp"/></div><div class="spacer-32 tablet-spacer-20"></div><h3 class="text-style-h5"><strong>Respond with AI</strong></h3><div class="spacer-10"></div><p>Canary’s AI Guest Messaging can respond to most complicated and multi-part inquiries so your team can focus on providing top-notch service.</p></div><div class="how-it-works-item"><div class="how-it-works-number"><div>3</div></div><div class="spacer-48 tablet-spacer-20"></div><div class="how-it-works-image-wrapper"><img width="140" loading="lazy" alt="Easily Track Authorizations visual" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c6d1141d51c77692887d502/653160f004c4ee2f9ce3d622_canary-illustrations-messages-files-and-image-upload-1-653160db93284.webp"/></div><div class="spacer-32 tablet-spacer-20"></div><h3 class="text-style-h5">No app downloads required</h3><div class="spacer-10"></div><p>Your guests don’t want another app. Increase adoption by 3-5x by keeping it app-less with Canary Messaging.</p></div><div class="registration-steps-line"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-main _56-56 background-color-lightgray hide-tablet"><div class="container-large"><div class="text-align-center"><h2 class="text-style-h3">What Our Customers Have To Say</h2></div><div class="spacer-40"></div><div class="swiper-container testimonials"><div class="swiper testimonials"><div class="swiper-wrapper testimonials"><div class="swiper-slide testimonials"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67d96a31f556fbb25bfa24cf/67ebfa2b07084f1db41957d7_Black.svg" alt="quotation mark"/><div class="spacer-16"></div><div>Before Canary, someone would have to spend at least an hour a day manually sending out pre-arrival messages to guests. Automating that has reduced our administrative work by at least 40%.</div><div class="spacer-32"></div><div class="flexbox gap-16 space-between align-center"><div class="flexbox gap-20"><img width="100" height="100" alt="Jason Reiplinger" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67d96a31f556fbb25bfa24cf/67ebfae4e676400451068c2e_Group%201000001214.svg" loading="lazy" class="mobile-hide"/><div><div class="testimonial-heading">Operations Manager</div><div class="testimonial-subheading">Crowne Plaza Perth</div></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide testimonials"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67d96a31f556fbb25bfa24cf/67ebfa2b07084f1db41957d7_Black.svg" alt="quotation mark"/><div class="spacer-16"></div><div>We love having Canary Guest Messaging! It&#x27;s great that we&#x27;re able to communicate with guests whenever it&#x27;s necessary. Our guests seem to enjoy using it too when they have inquiries, as some guests prefer to text over a phone call or email.</div><div class="spacer-32"></div><div class="flexbox gap-16 space-between align-center"><div class="flexbox gap-20"><img width="100" height="100" alt="Jason Reiplinger" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67d96a31f556fbb25bfa24cf/67ebfae4e676400451068c2e_Group%201000001214.svg" loading="lazy" class="mobile-hide"/><div><div class="testimonial-heading">Digital Marketing Manager</div><div class="testimonial-subheading">The LINE SF</div></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide testimonials"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67d96a31f556fbb25bfa24cf/67ebfa2b07084f1db41957d7_Black.svg" alt="quotation mark"/><div class="spacer-16"></div><div>Since we&#x27;ve started using Canary, guests have messaged us over 30,000 times. If that same volume had come to us over the phone, there&#x27;s no way we could have gotten to all of those guests.</div><div class="spacer-32"></div><div class="flexbox gap-16 space-between align-center"><div class="flexbox gap-20"><img width="100" height="100" alt="Jason Reiplinger" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67d96a31f556fbb25bfa24cf/67ebfae4e676400451068c2e_Group%201000001214.svg" loading="lazy" class="mobile-hide"/><div><div class="testimonial-heading">Corporate Director of Online Marketing</div><div class="testimonial-subheading">Linchris Hotels</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-nav-wrapper testimonials"><div class="swiper-nav prev testimonials"><div class="w-embed"><svg width="17" height="34" viewBox="0 0 17 34" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
