<path d="M7.072 4.208V5.008L0.728 8.32V6.912C0.728 6.80533 0.754667 6.70667 0.808 6.616C0.861333 6.52533 0.949333 6.45067 1.072 6.392L3.976 4.896C4.22667 4.77333 4.50133 4.67733 4.8 4.608C4.50133 4.53867 4.22667 4.44267 3.976 4.32L1.072 2.832C0.949333 2.768 0.861333 2.69333 0.808 2.608C0.754667 2.51733 0.728 2.41867 0.728 2.312V0.903999L7.072 4.208Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></a></div></div><div class="products-cards-item"><img width="Auto" height="44" alt="Product card icon" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67d96a31f556fbb25bfa24cf/680a2489f7df41427c4a36ca_security-02-blue-line.svg" loading="lazy"/><div class="spacer-16"></div><h3 class="text-style-h4">Secure Transactions</h3><div class="spacer-32"></div><p>Prevent fraud and chargebacks and streamline payment processes.</p><div class="spacer-16"></div><div class="flexbox justify-center"><a href="/products/secure-transactions" class="button-main is-text-button w-inline-block"><div class="text-size-18">Learn more</div><div class="icon-blue w-embed"><svg width="8" height="9" viewBox="0 0 8 9" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M7.072 4.208V5.008L0.728 8.32V6.912C0.728 6.80533 0.754667 6.70667 0.808 6.616C0.861333 6.52533 0.949333 6.45067 1.072 6.392L3.976 4.896C4.22667 4.77333 4.50133 4.67733 4.8 4.608C4.50133 4.53867 4.22667 4.44267 3.976 4.32L1.072 2.832C0.949333 2.768 0.861333 2.69333 0.808 2.608C0.754667 2.51733 0.728 2.41867 0.728 2.312V0.903999L7.072 4.208Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></a></div></div></div></div></section><div class="section-main _56-56"><div class="container-medium"><div class="text-align-center"><h2 class="text-style-h3">FAQs</h2><div class="margin-box _20-0-55-0"><p>A few helpful answers to common questions</p></div></div><div class="flexbox direction-vertical justify-center"><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-item w-dropdown"><div class="faq-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-question"><h3 class="text-style-h5">What is guest messaging software?</h3></div><div class="faq-arrow w-embed"><svg width="15" height="8" viewBox="0 0 15 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M14 1L7.5 7L1 1" stroke="black"/>
</svg></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq-line"></div><div class="max-width-1050"><p class="faq-answer">Guest messaging software is a hotel text messaging system that enables hotel staff to send messages and engage with guests in real time. It also enables a hotel to set up AI messaging to answer some of the most commonly asked questions from hotel guests.Guest Messaging is a hotel text messaging system that enables hotel staff to send messages and engage with their guests in real time. It also enables a hotel to set up AI messaging to answer some of the most commonly asked questions from hotel guests. <br/><br/>With Canary Guest Messaging, hotels can promote special offers, update guests on changes to their bookings, and provide personalized guest experiences. It also allows hotels to quickly respond to guest inquiries, provide customer service, and improve guest satisfaction.</p></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-item w-dropdown"><div class="faq-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-question"><h3 class="text-style-h5">Why is a hotel text messaging system like Canary Guest Messaging important for hoteliers?</h3></div><div class="faq-arrow w-embed"><svg width="15" height="8" viewBox="0 0 15 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M14 1L7.5 7L1 1" stroke="black"/>
</svg></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq-line"></div><div class="max-width-1050"><p class="faq-answer">A hotel text messaging system like Canary Guest Messaging is important because it allows hoteliers to respond quickly and efficiently to guest inquiries, concerns, and requests. Our hotel messaging platform allows hoteliers to provide a more personalized and efficient customer service experience to their guests, which helps to build loyalty and trust.</p></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-item w-dropdown"><div class="faq-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-question"><h3 class="text-style-h5">How does hotel guest messaging software work?</h3></div><div class="faq-arrow w-embed"><svg width="15" height="8" viewBox="0 0 15 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M14 1L7.5 7L1 1" stroke="black"/>
</svg></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq-line"></div><div class="max-width-1050"><p class="faq-answer">Hotel guest messaging software, which is sometimes referred to as a hotel text messaging system, enables hotels to send automated or manual messages to guests via SMS, email, or in-app notifications. The messages are tailored to each guest’s individual preferences and needs, such as mobile check-in instructions or updates about on-property events and amenities. <br/><br/>Hotels can also use the automated messaging system to communicate with guests about promotions, discounts, and special offers. The messages can be sent either manually or on a scheduled basis, depending on the hotel&#x27;s preference.<br/><br/>Additionally, hotels using Canary Guest Messaging have the option to send and receive text messages using their existing landline telephone number.</p></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-item w-dropdown"><div class="faq-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-question"><h3 class="text-style-h5">What are the key benefits of hotel guest messaging software?</h3></div><div class="faq-arrow w-embed"><svg width="15" height="8" viewBox="0 0 15 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M14 1L7.5 7L1 1" stroke="black"/>
</svg></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq-line"></div><div class="max-width-1050"><p class="faq-answer">A hotel text messaging system, like the one provided by Canary Technologies, offers a range of benefits to front desk agents, hotel management teams and, most importantly, guests.<br/><br/>1. Increased guest satisfaction: Hotel guest messaging software allows hotels to provide timely and helpful responses to their guests. This increases guest satisfaction and loyalty, leading to better online reviews and more repeat business.<br/>2. Improved efficiency: By streamlining guest communication processes, hotel guest messaging software can help to reduce the amount of time it takes to respond to inquiries and requests. This leads to a more efficient hotel operation and an improved guest experience.<br/>3. More revenue: Hotels can use automated messages to remind guests of special offers or discounts, prompting them to book or purchase additional services.<br/>4. Reduced costs: By automating guest communication processes and reducing the amount of time it takes to respond to inquiries, hotel guest messaging software can help reduce labor costs. This is especially helpful for hotels that are experiencing staffing shortages or need to find ways to run more efficiently and reduce costs.</p></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-item w-dropdown"><div class="faq-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-question"><h3 class="text-style-h5">What should hotels look for when choosing an automated messaging system software?</h3></div><div class="faq-arrow w-embed"><svg width="15" height="8" viewBox="0 0 15 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M14 1L7.5 7L1 1" stroke="black"/>
</svg></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq-line"></div><div class="max-width-1050"><p class="faq-answer">Ease of use for guests and your hotel staff should be the top concern for any hotelier evaluating choices for an automated messaging system. No new app downloads should be required by the guest and all messages should use a common means of communication like WhatsApp or SMS.<br/><br/>Additionally, more advanced hotel messaging platforms, like Canary, will leverage AI, pre-scheduled and broadcast messaging to increase staff efficiency.<br/><br/>Lastly, hotels should keep things as simple for their guests as possible. Therefore, hotel operators should look for platforms that enable them to send and receive messages using their existing landline.</p></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-item w-dropdown"><div class="faq-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-question"><h3 class="text-style-h5">How does Canary’s Guest Messaging elevate guest satisfaction?</h3></div><div class="faq-arrow w-embed"><svg width="15" height="8" viewBox="0 0 15 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M14 1L7.5 7L1 1" stroke="black"/>
</svg></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq-line"></div><div class="max-width-1050"><p class="faq-answer">Canary’s Guest Messaging transforms how you connect with guests by enabling fast, two-way communication via SMS and WhatsApp. From answering questions pre-arrival to resolving requests during the stay, your team can respond faster and more personally — no app downloads required. Hotels using Canary Guest Messaging often see higher satisfaction scores, fewer front desk bottlenecks and more glowing reviews.Ease of use for guests and your hotel staff should be the top concern for any hotelier evaluating choices for an automated messaging system. No new app downloads should be required by the guest and all messages should use a common means of communication like WhatsApp or SMS.</p></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-item w-dropdown"><div class="faq-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-question"><h3 class="text-style-h5">Can Canary Guest Messaging integrate with your existing PMS?</h3></div><div class="faq-arrow w-embed"><svg width="15" height="8" viewBox="0 0 15 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M14 1L7.5 7L1 1" stroke="black"/>
</svg></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq-line"></div><div class="max-width-1050"><p class="faq-answer">Yes. Canary’s Guest Messaging integrates seamlessly with all major Property Management Systems (PMSs). These deep integrations automatically sync guest profiles and reservation data, so your team always has the context they need to respond efficiently without toggling between tools.</p></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="faq-item w-dropdown"><div class="faq-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="faq-question"><h3 class="text-style-h5">How does Canary Guest Messaging increase hotel staff operational efficiency?</h3></div><div class="faq-arrow w-embed"><svg width="15" height="8" viewBox="0 0 15 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M14 1L7.5 7L1 1" stroke="black"/>
</svg></div></div><nav class="faq-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq-line"></div><div class="max-width-1050"><p class="faq-answer">By consolidating guest messages in a centralized dashboard and automating routine replies, Canary’s Guest Messaging saves staff hours of manual work each week. Real-time alerts and quick replies mean fewer calls, less time spent chasing down guest requests, and more time focused on service.</p></div></nav></div></div></div></div><section class="section-main _50-50 bg-color-lightblue"><div class="container-small"><div class="text-align-center"><h2 class="text-style-h3">AI On Canary Guest Messaging</h2><div class="spacer-16"></div><p>See what your favorite LLM has to say</p></div><div class="spacer-64"></div><div class="max-width-780 margin-center"><div class="gridbox _3-col"><a href="https://chatgpt.com/?q=How%20would%20the%20AI%20guest%20messaging%20tool%20at%20canarytechnologies.com/products/guest-messaging%20help%20my%20hotel%20communicate%20better%20with%20guests%2C%20and%20what%20are%20the%20technology%20and%20operations%20considerations%20I%20should%20be%20aware%20of%3F" target="_blank" class="ai-item w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c6d1141d51c77692887d502/6a107359467cf92f5a57743c_Vector%20(26).svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="position-relative z-index-1"/><div class="ai-item-link"><div>Ask ChatGPT</div><div>&gt;</div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c6d1141d51c77692887d502/6a10740117b79387b61f77f8_Ask%20ChatGPT%20(1).avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="ai-item-image"/></a><a href="https://claude.ai/new?q=How%20would%20the%20AI%20guest%20messaging%20tool%20at%20canarytechnologies.com/products/guest-messaging%20help%20my%20hotel%20communicate%20better%20with%20guests%2C%20and%20what%20are%20the%20technology%20and%20operations%20considerations%20I%20should%20be%20aware%20of%3F" target="_blank" class="ai-item w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c6d11